- golden nc/inch/fanuc-lathe/axial_drill.nc gains `G00 X0 Z1.1811`
  after G80: main's #1011 exit rapid (the mm golden's `G00 X0 Z30`),
  in inch. Regenerated with WRITE_GOLDEN=1; no other golden moved.
- lathe_post_inch::a_peck_counts_the_inch_increment's stream now
  approaches R before its cycle (first_move 1): main's #1026 refuses a
  face cycle that is its section's first motion, so the fixture's G83
  never posted. Its asserted words are unchanged.

